## 🛡️ Security & Best Practices Implemented

| Concern | Solution |
|---|---|
| **SQL Injection** | All values are bound as `PreparedStatement` parameters; identifiers validated against regex whitelist |
| **Password Storage** | AES-256 encrypted with Jasypt before saving to Elasticsearch |
| **Connection Leaks** | HikariCP pooling with one pool per configured database |
| **Runaway Queries** | Enforced `maxResults` cap + query timeout |
| **Dialect Differences** | `DatabaseType` enum encapsulates quoting and pagination syntax |
| **Validation** | Bean Validation + connection test before saving configs |
| **Multi-tenant Pools** | `DataSourceManager` lazy-initializes & caches pools by config ID |

